faces
1	33 17 -34 -1 tension tens constraint 5,6,7,8
2	34 18 -35 -2 tension tens constraint 5,6,7,8
3	35 19 -36 -3 tension tens constraint 5,6,7,8
4	36 20 -37 -4 tension tens constraint 5,6,7,8
